gs":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"The type is auto-detected unless `--type` is given. For time-ordered IDs (UUID v7, ULID, TypeID, KSUID, ObjectID, XID, TSID), inspect extracts the embedded timestamp. Random-only IDs (UUID v4, CUID v2, Nanoid) report that no decodable metadata is available. Timestamp precision matches each generator: UUID v7, ULID, and TSID are millisecond-precision; KSUID, ObjectID, and XID are second-precision."},"100":{"id":"/docs/cli-98","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"Option"},"101":{"id":"/docs/cli-99","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"Description"},"102":{"id":"/docs/cli-100","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"`--type`"},"103":{"id":"/docs/cli-101","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"ID type: `uuid`, `ulid`, `typeid`, `nanoid`, `cuid`, `ksuid`, `objectid`, `xid`, `tsid` (auto-detected if omitted)"},"104":{"id":"/docs/cli-102","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"`--json`"},"105":{"id":"/docs/cli-103","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#inspect","content":"Output as JSON"},"106":{"id":"/docs/cli-104","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#validate","content":"Check whether an ID is well-formed, one at a time or in bulk from stdin."},"107":{"id":"/docs/cli-105","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#validate","content":"Option"},"108":{"id":"/docs/cli-106","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#validate","content":"Description"},"109":{"id":"/docs/cli-107","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#validate","content":"`--type`"},"110":{"id":"/docs/cli-108","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#validate","content":"Expected ID type (auto-detec